data: {"type":"CUSTOM","name":"on_interrupt","value":{"id":"2ea9b6e7ea55c59cb12c6d1bc041db62","reason":"human_input","metadata":{"kind":"ask_user_question","steps":[{"id":"plugin-development-decision","question":"是否按此方案开发？","description":"目标: 点击知道了收起帮助内容，点击标题重新展开；切换主题后仍可使用。\n\n需要新增的能力: 卡片当前没有供子插件使用的展开控制接口\n\n目标插件与位置: quick-help-dismiss (dismiss-help)\nquick-help-card.headerActions\n\n类型与生命周期: semantic-slot; 随帮助卡片启用\n\n界面范围: 复用卡片按钮与现有主题变量\n\n数据范围: 仅页面内展开状态，无网络请求\n\n涉及的依赖: help.card\n\n预计修改范围: src/agent-ui/plugins/quick-help-dismiss/\nsrc/agent-ui/plugins/quick-help-card/index.tsx\nsrc/agent-ui/plugins/quick-help-card/definition.ts\nsrc/agent-ui/services/help-card.ts\n\n一并授权的服务及提供方 → 使用方:\nhelp.card (create): quick-help-card → quick-help-dismiss (required)\n按钮和卡片共用展开状态\n\n验证方式与交互: runtime\n收起与重新展开; 主题切换\n\n不包含 vendor、Runtime 修改或源码接管；这些操作需要独立授权。","options":[{"id":"start","label":"开始开发"},{"id":"adjust","label":"调整需求"},{"id":"defer","label":"暂不处理"}],"selectionMode":"single","minSelections":1,"maxSelections":1}]}}}

